<title>DUBAI: SAUDI HALTS BEEF IMPORTS FROM BELGIUM.</title>
<headline>SAUDI HALTS BEEF IMPORTS FROM BELGIUM.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Arabia imposed a ban on beef and beef-related products imported from or through Belgium, the official Saudi Press Agency (SPA) reported on Monday.</p>
<p>It said the move followed evidence that some Belgian companies were exporting banned British beef to the kingdom under false Belgian certificates of origin.</p>
<p>&quot;The ban includes all beef and related products,&quot; SPA quoted an official at the Saudi Ministry of Trade as saying.</p>
<p>Saudi Arabia, where meat is a major staple for its 18 million population, imposed a ban on British beef in 1996 after scares that mad cow disease could affect humans.</p>
</text>
